CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ member: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ variable: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ functional cast and unscoped enumeration: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
List-initialization of an enumeration with a fixed underlying type from an
integer was rejected ("invalid implicit conversion"); the MSVC STL's
_Fs_file initializes its handle member as `_Raw{reinterpret_cast<intptr_t>(
_Handle)}', which dropped std::filesystem's file operations on VS 2022.
